{"v":4,"catch":"新たな源平合戦が今、幕をあける――","desc":"平家と源氏の命運をわけた『平治の乱』から十五年――。\n栄華を極めた平家はこの世の春を謳歌し、敗れた源氏は没落の中にあった。\n\nかろうじて命を助けられた源氏の御曹司・遮那王は、\n山深い鞍馬に預けられ、修行の日々を送っていた。\n\nそんな遮那王には誰にも知られてはならない秘密があった。\n――実は女だという重大な秘密が。","publisher":"アイディアファクトリー","release":"2020-09-17","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日本語"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"D","size":"Switch 2 6.4GB / Switch 6.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c521ec4e74cac73e6b622ecf732cab96332573f555ef2f6962113c1521ee1ea5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/24e77438de317c639a89d16c7be18463ccb9a8d6f331f2f683dca0362100a3b5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/066146ab5908e845a3c04b7cd99bfd74f849e8d399d32290ba45fba355060f56.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2880071daa5268808e36e39c02faeff0a514d1bac79ae6406558a770771ecb0e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/569c280e1a41b14c2ca439f38fda012ae160293c1a41496dd792c6ee7cd4d906.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9e9c90d55fe4c933199ead3b50f1852ba40c9175782923bd53021f8d51d5d984.jpg"],"vids":["cFk5uH7SM-I"],"titleId":"0100be900c590000"}